<title>UK: Merrill to lead jumbo mark bond for Citibank CCMT.</title>
<headline>Merrill to lead jumbo mark bond for Citibank CCMT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch will lead manage a 1.0 billion mark fixed rate asset backed bond for Citibank Credit Card Master Trust next week, a syndicate official told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;This will be the third Citibank deal of its kind in marks,&quot; the syndicate official said.</p>
<p>The deal will have a 10-year maturity and will be priced to yield in the mid-20 basis points over the July 2007 Bund.</p>
<p>The bond -- backed by credit card receivables -- will be launched on Tuesday or Wednesday next week.</p>
<p>-- Hayley Pienaar, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
